{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43559","headline":"喜遇刘二十八偶书两韵联句 · 裴度","name":"喜遇刘二十八偶书两韵联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病来佳兴少，老去旧游稀。\n笑语纵横作，杯觞络绎飞。\n清谈如水玉，逸韵贯珠玑。\n高位当金铉，虚怀似布衣。\n已容狂取乐，仍任醉忘机。\n舍眷将何适，留欢便是归。\n凤仪常欲附，蚊力自知微。\n愿假尊罍末，膺门自此依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}